`s 42(1)(a): the last day on which notice of a motion to disallow may be given` MEANS
    `the nth sitting day after a day` `s 42(1): the number of sitting days allowed` `the sitting days of the House, in date order` `the day the instrument was laid before the House`

@ref s 42(1) (src:742-745)
GIVEN `the sitting days of the House, in date order` IS A LIST OF DATE
      `the day the instrument was laid before the House` IS A DATE
      `the day notice was given` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 42(1)(a): notice of a motion to disallow is given in time` MEANS
    `a day falls within the first n sitting days after a day` `s 42(1): the number of sitting days allowed` `the sitting days of the House, in date order` `the day the instrument was laid before the House` `the day notice was given`

@ref s 42(1)(b) (src:742-745)
GIVEN `the sitting days of the House, in date order` IS A LIST OF DATE
      `the day notice was given` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`s 42(1)(b): the last day on which the House may pass the resolution after notice` MEANS
    `the nth sitting day after a day` `s 42(1): the number of sitting days allowed` `the sitting days of the House, in date order` `the day notice was given`

@ref s 42(1)(b) (src:742-745)
GIVEN `the sitting days of the House, in date order` IS A LIST OF DATE
      `the day notice was given` IS A DATE
      `the day the resolution was passed` IS A DATE
